# ============================================
# WHAT THIS FILE DOES (plain English):
# Keeps the container build fast and small by NOT copying junk into it. We skip
# installed packages, build outputs, the mobile app's native folders, the design
# reference, and infra output. The Dockerfile re-installs exactly what it needs.
# ============================================
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.expo
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/android
design
infra/aws/cdk.out
.git
.github
.cursor
**/*.log
.DS_Store
